{"id": "32829", "title": "平凡的世界", "author": "路遥", "category": "文学名著", "count": 162, "available": 0, "cover": "", "status": "已完成", "source": "files/article/info/32/32829.htm", "intro": "这是一部全景式地表现中国当代城乡社会生活的长篇小说。全书共三部。作者在近十年间广阔背景上，通过复杂的矛盾纠葛，刻画了社会各阶层众多普通人的形象。劳动与爱情，挫折与追求，痛苦与欢乐，日常生活与巨大的社会冲突，纷繁地交织在一起，深刻地展示了普通人在大时代历史进程中所走过的艰难曲折的道路。特别是主人公面对困境艰苦奋斗的精神，对今天的人们仍有极大影响。", "base": "files/article/html/32/32829", "chapters": [{"title": "第一部", "volume": true}, {"title": "第01章", "file": "2097446.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第02章", "file": "2097447.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第03章", "file": "2097448.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第04章", "file": "2097449.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第05章", "file": "2097450.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第06章", "file": "2097451.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第07章", "file": "2097452.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第08章", "file": "2097453.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第09章", "file": "2097454.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第10章", "file": "2097455.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第11章", "file": "2097456.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第12章", "file": "2097457.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第13章", "file": "2097458.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第14章", "file": "2097459.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第15章", "file": "2097460.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第16章", "file": "2097461.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第17章", "file": "2097462.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第18章", "file": "2097463.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第19章", "file": "2097464.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第20章", "file": "2097465.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第21章", "file": "2097466.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第22章", "file": "2097467.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第23章", "file": "2097468.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第24章", "file": "2097469.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第25章", "file": "2097470.html",